OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested over pub car park
OL,4,Amurder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murdering a man found
OL,8,Fstabbed in a pub car park.
OL,10,FAyden Cooper, 25, died at the scene at
OL,11,Fthe Beggars Bush pub, on Chester Road,
OL,12,Fin Sutton Coldfield, just before 02:00
OL,13,FBST on 11 October.
OL,15,FIn a tribute, the family of the
OL,16,Ffather-of-two said he was "full of life
OL,17,Fand had a heart of gold".
OL,19,FThree men, aged 18 and 21, were
OL,20,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,21,Fremained in custody, police said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
